Step 1. For each micro-architecture, unpack the header and the libraries in the same folder; i.e., "include" and "lib" directories are at the same level after unpacking.
Step 2. If using VS2022, then rename dev_i386/lib/vc14x_dll to be dev_i386/lib/vc143_dll, and rename dev_amd64/lib/vc14x_x64_dll to be dev_amd64/lib/vc143_x64_dll. This is because the <setup.h> in wxWidgets requires these modifications for Visual Studio. 